   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"4\">\n  <li>The correlation coefficient, <span data-math=\"r\">r</span>, is given for several different linear models. Order the correlation coefficients as follows: start with the <span data-math=\"r\">r</span>-value indicating the strongest linear relationship and end with the <span data-math=\"r\">r</span>-value indicating the weakest linear relationship</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span data-math=\"-0.65, 0.47, -1, 0.89\">-0.65, 0.47, -1, 0.89</span></p>",
